	(text "Debug sheet: nothing here is needed for the robot to run. It only helps find faults.\nLED currents: green about 0.3-0.8 mA, red about 1.4 mA, yellow about 2.8 mA. The BAT ON LED draws under 1 mA, which is negligible for AA cells.\nD2 (3V3, green) is on the Power Conversion sheet.\nTest pads carry no parts and are not in the BOM. Probe them with the board powered, black probe on a GND pad."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 160.02 0)
		(effects
